nk to open the application form.","synonyms":["select"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Technology Basics","word":"battery","meaning":"a device that stores power for electronic equipment","translation":"pin","example":"A weak battery can interrupt an online lesson.","synonyms":["power cell"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Technology Basics","word":"charger","meaning":"a device used to put electrical power into a battery","translation":"bộ sạc","example":"I always carry a phone charger when travelling.","synonyms":["charging device"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Technology Basics","word":"Wi-Fi","meaning":"a wireless system that connects devices to the internet","translation":"mạng Wi-Fi","example":"Free Wi-Fi is available in many public libraries.","synonyms":["wireless internet"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Technology Basics","word":"mobile phone","meaning":"a portable telephone that can connect to wireless networks","translation":"điện thoại di động","example":"A mobile phone is useful during emergencies.","synonyms":["cell phone"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Technology Basics","word":"useful app","meaning":"a mobile or computer program that helps with a task","translation":"ứng dụng hữu ích","example":"A useful app can help learners review vocabulary.","synonyms":["helpful application"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Technology Basics","word":"internet connection","meaning":"a link that allows a device to access the internet","translation":"kết nối internet","example":"A stable internet connection is necessary for video lessons.","synonyms":["online connection"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Environment Basics","word":"pollute","meaning":"to make