om harmful pollution","translation":"không khí sạch","example":"More trees can help cities maintain cleaner air.","synonyms":["unpolluted air"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Environment Basics","word":"green area","meaning":"land covered with grass, trees or plants","translation":"khu vực xanh","example":"Every neighbourhood should have a green area for residents.","synonyms":["green space"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Environment Basics","word":"plant a tree","meaning":"to put a young tree into the ground so it can grow","translation":"trồng cây","example":"Schools can encourage children to plant a tree.","synonyms":["grow a tree"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Environment Basics","word":"cut down trees","meaning":"to remove trees by cutting them","translation":"chặt cây","example":"Companies should avoid cutting down trees unnecessarily.","synonyms":["fell trees"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Environment Basics","word":"protect wildlife","meaning":"to keep wild animals and plants safe","translation":"bảo vệ động vật hoang dã","example":"National parks help protect wildlife.","synonyms":["conserve wildlife"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Environment Basics","word":"use less plastic","meaning":"to reduce the amount of plastic consumed","translation":"giảm sử dụng nhựa","example":"Shoppers can use less plastic by carrying reusable bags.","synonyms":["reduce plastic use"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Environment Basics","word":"reusable bag","meaning":"a bag designed to be used many times","translation":"túi tái sử dụng","example":"A reusable bag creates less waste than a single-use bag.","synonyms":["shopping bag for repeated use"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Environment Basics","word":"public park","meaning":"a green place open to everyone for recreation","translation":"công viên công cộng","example":"A public park can improve life in a crowded city.","synonyms":["city park"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Environment Basics","word":"clean up","meaning":"to remove rubbish or dirt from a place","translation":"dọn dẹp","example":"Volunteers meet monthly to clean up the beach.","synonyms":["tidy"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Environment Basics","word":"protect the planet","meaning":"to act in ways that reduce environmental harm","translation":"bảo vệ hành tinh","example":"Small daily choices can help protect the planet.","synonyms":["protect the environment"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Environment Basics","word":"environmental problem","meaning":"a problem that harms nature or human surroundings","translation":"vấn đề môi trường","example":"Air pollution is a serious environmental problem in many cities.","synonyms":["ecological problem"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"motorbike","meaning":"a two-wheeled motor vehicle","translation":"xe máy","example":"Motorbikes are a common form of transport in many Asian cities.","synonyms":["motorcycle"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"taxi","meaning":"a car with a driver that passengers pay to use","translation":"taxi","example":"Taking a taxi can be convenient late at night.","synonyms":["cab"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"subway","meaning":"an underground urban railway","translation":"tàu điện ngầm","example":"The subway can carry large numbers of commuters.","synonyms":["metro"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"station","meaning":"a place where trains or buses regularly stop","translation":"nhà ga, trạm","example":"The train station is close to the city centre.","synonyms":["terminal"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"bus stop","meaning":"a place where buses stop to pick up passengers","translation":"trạm xe buýt","example":"The nearest bus stop is five minutes from my house.","synonyms":["bus station point"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"ticket","meaning":"a document or electronic record allowing travel","translation":"vé","example":"Passengers can buy a ticket using a mobile app.","synonyms":["travel pass"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"fare","meaning":"the money paid for a journey on public transport","translation":"giá vé","example":"Lower bus fares may encourage people to use public transport.","synonyms":["travel charge"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"seat belt","meaning":"a safety belt used in a vehicle","translation":"dây an toàn","example":"Drivers and passengers should always wear a seat belt.","synonyms":["safety belt"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"traffic light","meaning":"a coloured light system controlling road traffic","translation":"đèn giao thông","example":"Drivers must stop when the traffic light is red.","synonyms":["road signal"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"cross the road","meaning":"to move from one side of a road to the other","translation":"qua đường","example":"Children should learn how to cross the road safely.","synonyms":["cross a street"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"walking","meaning":"travelling on foot","translation":"đi bộ","example":"Walking short distances can reduce traffic and improve health.","synonyms":["going on foot"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"cycle to work","meaning":"to travel to a job by bicycle","translation":"đạp xe đi làm","example":"Some people cycle to work to save money and stay fit.","synonyms":["bike to work"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"get on a bus","meaning":"to enter a bus","translation":"lên xe buýt","example":"Passengers should wait until others leave before they get on a bus.","synonyms":["board a bus"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"get off a bus","meaning":"to leave a bus","translation":"xuống xe buýt","example":"I usually get off the bus near the university.","synonyms":["leave a bus"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"miss a train","meaning":"to arrive too late to travel on a planned train","translation":"lỡ tàu","example":"Commuters may miss a train when roads are congested.","synonyms":["fail to catch a train"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"catch a bus","meaning":"to reach a bus in time and travel on it","translation":"bắt xe buýt","example":"I leave home early so I can catch a bus to work.","synonyms":["take a bus"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"traffic jam","meaning":"a line of vehicles moving very slowly or not at all","translation":"kẹt xe","example":"A traffic jam can double the time needed for a journey.","synonyms":["road congestion"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"road user","meaning":"a person who uses a road as a driver, cyclist or pedestrian","translation":"người tham gia giao thông","example":"Every road user should follow safety rules.","synonyms":["person using the road"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"breakfast","meaning":"the first meal of the day","translation":"bữa sáng","example":"A healthy breakfast can provide energy for study.","synonyms":["morning meal"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"lunch","meaning":"a meal eaten around the middle of the day","translation":"bữa trưa","example":"Many office workers buy lunch near their workplace.","synonyms":["midday meal"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"dinner","meaning":"the main evening meal","translation":"bữa tối","example":"Families often talk together during dinner.","synonyms":["evening meal"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"snack","meaning":"a small amount of food eaten between meals","translation":"đồ ăn nhẹ","example":"Fruit is a healthier snack than sweets.","synonyms":["light food"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"bread","meaning":"food made from flour and baked in an oven","translation":"bánh mì","example":"Whole-grain bread can provide fibre.","synonyms":["loaf"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"rice","meaning":"a common grain eaten as a main food in many countries","translation":"gạo, cơm","example":"Rice is a basic part of many Asian meals.","synonyms":["grain"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"fish","meaning":"an animal that lives in water and is commonly eaten as food","translation":"cá","example":"Eating fish can be part of a balanced diet.","synonyms":["seafood"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"milk","meaning":"a white liquid food produced by mammals and commonly consumed","translation":"sữa","example":"Some children drink milk at breakfast.","synonyms":["dairy drink"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"water","meaning":"a clear liquid essential for life","translation":"nước","example":"People should drink enough water during hot weather.","synonyms":["drinking water"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"soft drink","meaning":"a sweet non-alcoholic fizzy or still drink","translation":"nước ngọt","example":"Frequent consumption of soft drinks can increase sugar intake.","synonyms":["soda"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"homemade food","meaning":"food prepared at home rather than bought ready-made","translation":"đồ ăn nhà làm","example":"Homemade food is often cheaper than restaurant meals.","synonyms":["home-cooked food"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"eat out","meaning":"to have a meal in a restaurant or cafe","translation":"ăn ngoài","example":"Young adults often eat out at weekends.","synonyms":["dine out"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"order food","meaning":"to ask a restaurant or delivery service to prepare food","translation":"gọi món","example":"Customers can order food through a mobile application.","synonyms":["place a food order"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"food choice","meaning":"a decision about what to eat","translation":"lựa chọn thực phẩm","example":"Price strongly influences food choices for many families.","synonyms":["dietary choice"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"healthy meal","meaning":"a meal containing nutritious foods in suitable amounts","translation":"bữa ăn lành mạnh","example":"A healthy meal should include vegetables and protein.","synonyms":["nutritious meal"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"fried food","meaning":"food cooked in hot oil","translation":"đồ chiên","example":"Too much fried food may increase health risks.","synonyms":["deep-fried food"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"sweet food","meaning":"food containing a lot of sugar","translation":"đồ ngọt","example":"Children often prefer sweet food to vegetables.","synonyms":["sugary food"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"eating habit","meaning":"a regular pattern of food choice and consumption","translation":"thói quen ăn uống","example":"Eating habits often develop during childhood.","synonyms":["dietary habit"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Housing & Cities","word":"room","meaning":"a separate part of a building enclosed by walls","translation":"phòng","example":"The apartment has two bedrooms and a small living room.","synonyms":["space"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Housing & Cities","word":"bedroom","meaning":"a room used mainly for sleeping","translation":"phòng ngủ","example":"Each child has a small bedroom.","synonyms":["sleeping room"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Housing & Cities","word":"kitchen","meaning":"a room where food is prepared","translation":"nhà bếp","example":"Many families spend time together in the kitchen.","synonyms":["cooking area"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Housing & Cities","word":"living room","meaning":"a room used for relaxing and receiving visitors","translation":"phòng khách","example":"The living room is the largest room in the house.","synonyms":["lounge"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Housing & Cities","word":"balcony","meaning":"a raised outdoor platform attached to a building","translation":"ban công","example":"The apartment has a balcony overlooking the park.","synonyms":["terrace"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Housing & Cities","word":"downtown district","meaning":"the central commercial and activity area of a city","translation":"khu trung tâm thành phố","example":"Housing in a downtown district is often more expensive than in outer areas.","synonyms":["central district"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Housing & Cities","word":"suburb","meaning":"a residential area outside the central part of a city","translation":"vùng ngoại ô","example":"Many families move to a suburb for more space.","synonyms":["residential outskirts"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Housing & Cities","word":"countryside","meaning":"land outside cities and towns, often used for farming","translation":"nông thôn","example":"The countryside is usually quieter than a large city.","synonyms":["rural area"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Housing & Cities","word":"quiet area","meaning":"a place with little noise or activity","translation":"khu vực yên tĩnh","example":"Older residents may prefer to live in a quiet area.","synonyms":["peaceful neighbourhood"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Housing & Cities","word":"busy street","meaning":"a road with heavy traffic or many people","translation":"đường phố đông đúc","example":"Living beside a busy street can be noisy.","synonyms":["crowded road"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Housing & Cities","word":"move house","meaning":"to change from one home to another","translation":"chuyển nhà","example":"Families may move house when they need more space.","synonyms":["relocate home"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Housing & Cities","word":"live alone","meaning":"to have a home without other people living there","translation":"sống một mình","example":"More young professionals are choosing to live alone.","synonyms":["live independently"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Housing & Cities","word":"share a flat","meaning":"to live in an apartment with another person","translation":"ở chung căn hộ","example":"Students often share a flat to reduce costs.","synonyms":["share accommodation"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Housing & Cities","word":"housing cost","meaning":"the money required for rent, mortgage and home expenses","translation":"chi phí nhà ở","example":"Housing costs take a large part of many household budgets.","synonyms":["cost of housing"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Housing & Cities","word":"safe neighbourhood","meaning":"an area where residents face little crime or danger","translation":"khu dân cư an toàn","example":"Parents often look for a safe neighbourhood near good schools.","synonyms":["secure area"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Housing & Cities","word":"city life","meaning":"the experience of living in an urban area","translation":"cuộc sống thành thị","example":"City life offers convenience but can also be stressful.","synonyms":["urban life"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Housing & Cities","word":"country life","meaning":"the experience of living in a rural area","translation":"cuộc sống nông thôn","example":"Country life may provide more contact with nature.","synonyms":["rural life"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Housing & Cities","word":"place to live","meaning":"a home or area where someone lives","translation":"nơi để sống","example":"Affordability influences people's choice of a place to live.","synonyms":["home"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Media & Communication","word":"text message","meaning":"a short written message sent by phone","translation":"tin nhắn văn bản","example":"A text message is useful for quick communication.","synonyms":["SMS"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Media & Communication","word":"email message","meaning":"a written electronic message sent over the internet","translation":"thư điện tử","example":"Formal information is often sent in an email message.","synonyms":["electronic message"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Media & Communication","word":"chat online","meaning":"to communicate informally through the internet","translation":"trò chuyện trực tuyến","example":"Friends who live far apart can chat online.","synonyms":["message online"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Media & Communication","word":"share a photo","meaning":"to send or publish a photograph for other people to see","translation":"chia sẻ ảnh","example":"Many users share a photo from their holidays on social media.","synonyms":["post a picture"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Media & Communication","word":"watch the news","meaning":"to view television or online reports about current events","translation":"xem tin tức","example":"Some people watch the news every evening.","synonyms":["follow the news"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Media & Communication","word":"read an article","meaning":"to read a piece of writing in a newspaper, magazine or website","translation":"đọc bài viết","example":"Students may read an article before a class discussion.","synonyms":["read a report"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Media & Communication","word":"TV channel","meaning":"a television service that broadcasts programmes","translation":"kênh truyền hình","example":"The TV channel shows documentaries every weekend.","synonyms":["television station"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Media & Communication","word":"news website","meaning":"a website that publishes information about current events","translation":"trang web tin tức","example":"Young adults often use a news website instead of a newspaper.","synonyms":["online news site"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Media & Communication","word":"online video","meaning":"a video watched through the internet","translation":"video trực tuyến","example":"Short online videos are popular with teenagers.","synonyms":["web video"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Media & Communication","word":"video platform","meaning":"a website or app for watching and sharing videos","translation":"nền tảng video","example":"A video platform can be used for both entertainment and learning.","synonyms":["video service"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Media & Communication","word":"follow an account","meaning":"to subscribe to updates from a social media user","translation":"theo dõi tài khoản","example":"People often follow an account that shares useful information.","synonyms":["subscribe to an account"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Media & Communication","word":"post online","meaning":"to publish text, pictures or video on the internet","translation":"đăng trực tuyến","example":"Users should think carefully before they post online.","synonyms":["publish online"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Media & Communication","word":"send a message","meaning":"to communicate information to another person","translation":"gửi tin nhắn","example":"It is easy to send a message from a smartphone.","synonyms":["message someone"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Media & Communication","word":"face-to-face conversation","meaning":"communication between people who are physically together","translation":"cuộc trò chuyện trực tiếp","example":"A face-to-face conversation can feel more personal than texting.","synonyms":["in-person conversation"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Media & Communication","word":"communication tool","meaning":"a method or device used to exchange information","translation":"công cụ giao tiếp","example":"Video calls are an important communication tool for remote teams.","synonyms":["means of communication"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Media & Communication","word":"public information","meaning":"information provided for the general population","translation":"thông tin công cộng","example":"Clear public information is essential during emergencies.","synonyms":["information for the public"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Media & Communication","word":"news story","meaning":"a report about a recent event","translation":"bản tin","example":"The news story focused on rising housing costs.","synonyms":["news report"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Media & Communication","word":"media content","meaning":"information or entertainment produced for media platforms","translation":"nội dung truyền thông","example":"Children are exposed to many 