 time","meaning":"time when a person is free from work or duties","translation":"thời gian rảnh","example":"People choose different hobbies in their spare time.","synonyms":["free time"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Sport & Leisure","word":"weekend activity","meaning":"something people do for leisure at weekends","translation":"hoạt động cuối tuần","example":"Cycling is a popular weekend activity.","synonyms":["weekend pastime"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Sport & Leisure","word":"have fun","meaning":"to enjoy an activity or situation","translation":"vui chơi","example":"Sport can help children exercise and have fun.","synonyms":["enjoy oneself"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Sport & Leisure","word":"join a team","meaning":"to become a member of a sports or working group","translation":"tham gia đội","example":"Young players learn cooperation when they join a team.","synonyms":["become a team member"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Sport & Leisure","word":"healthy activity","meaning":"an activity that supports physical or mental well-being","translation":"hoạt động lành mạnh","example":"Walking in a park is a simple healthy activity.","synonyms":["beneficial activity"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Money & Consumer Life","word":"cash","meaning":"money in the form of coins and notes","translation":"tiền mặt","example":"Some small shops still prefer cash payments.","synonyms":["physical money"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Money & Consumer Life","word":"bank account","meaning":"an arrangement with a bank for keeping and managing money","translation":"tài khoản ngân hàng","example":"Workers usually receive their salary in a bank account.","synonyms":["account"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Money & Consumer Life","word":"credit card","meaning":"a card that allows a person to borrow money for purchases","translation":"thẻ tín dụng","example":"Credit cards make online shopping convenient.","synonyms":["payment card"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Money & Consumer Life","word":"debit card","meaning":"a card that pays directly from money in a bank account","translation":"thẻ ghi nợ","example":"Many customers use a debit card for daily purchases.","synonyms":["bank card"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Money & Consumer Life","word":"bill","meaning":"a written or electronic request for payment","translation":"hóa đơn","example":"Households must plan for electricity and water bills.","synonyms":["invoice"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Money & Consumer Life","word":"receipt","meaning":"a document showing that payment has been made","translation":"biên lai","example":"Customers should keep a receipt in case they return an item.","synonyms":["proof of purchase"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Money & Consumer Life","word":"pocket money","meaning":"small amounts of money given regularly to a child","translation":"tiền tiêu vặt","example":"Pocket money can teach children basic budgeting.","synonyms":["allowance"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Money & Consumer Life","word":"save up","meaning":"to gradually collect money for a future purpose","translation":"tiết kiệm dần","example":"Students may save up for a new laptop.","synonyms":["put money aside"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Money & Consumer Life","word":"waste money","meaning":"to spend money on things that are unnecessary or poor value","translation":"lãng phí tiền","example":"Advertising can encourage people to waste money.","synonyms":["spend carelessly"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Money & Consumer Life","word":"special offer","meaning":"a temporary lower price or extra benefit for customers","translation":"ưu đãi đặc biệt","example":"A special offer may attract new shoppers.","synonyms":["promotion"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Money & Consumer Life","word":"sale price","meaning":"a reduced price during a sale","translation":"giá khuyến mãi","example":"Customers often wait for a sale price before buying clothes.","synonyms":["discounted price"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Money & Consumer Life","word":"compare prices","meaning":"to examine different prices before deciding what to buy","translation":"so sánh giá","example":"Online shoppers can compare prices quickly.","synonyms":["check prices"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Money & Consumer Life","word":"shopping centre","meaning":"a large building or area containing many shops","translation":"trung tâm mua sắm","example":"The shopping centre is busiest at weekends.","synonyms":["mall"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Money & Consumer Life","word":"local shop","meaning":"a small store serving people in a nearby area","translation":"cửa hàng địa phương","example":"Buying from a local shop can support the community.","synonyms":["neighbourhood store"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Money & Consumer Life","word":"buy online","meaning":"to purchase goods through the internet","translation":"mua trực tuyến","example":"People increasingly buy online because it is convenient.","synonyms":["shop online"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Money & Consumer Life","word":"return an item","meaning":"to take a product back to a seller for refund or exchange","translation":"trả lại hàng","example":"Customers may return an item if it is damaged.","synonyms":["take a product back"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Money & Consumer Life","word":"cheap product","meaning":"a product that costs relatively little money","translation":"sản phẩm giá rẻ","example":"A cheap product is not always good value.","synonyms":["low-cost item"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Money & Consumer Life","word":"shopping habit","meaning":"a regular pattern in the way a person buys things","translation":"thói quen mua sắm","example":"Online advertising can influence shopping habits.","synonyms":["buying habit"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Animals & Wildlife","word":"wild animal","meaning":"an animal living naturally rather than being kept by people","translation":"động vật hoang dã","example":"People should not feed wild animals in national parks.","synonyms":["animal in nature"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Animals & Wildlife","word":"farm","meaning":"an area of land used for growing crops or keeping animals","translation":"nông trại","example":"Children can learn where food comes from by visiting a farm.","synonyms":["agricultural land"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Animals & Wildlife","word":"farm worker","meaning":"a person employed to carry out practical work on a farm","translation":"lao động nông trại","example":"Farm workers may have long days during harvest season.","synonyms":["agricultural worker"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Animals & Wildlife","word":"cow","meaning":"a large farm animal kept for milk or meat","translation":"bò","example":"Cows need enough water and grazing land.","synonyms":["cattle"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Animals & Wildlife","word":"sheep","meaning":"a farm animal kept for wool and meat","translation":"cừu","example":"Sheep are common in some rural areas.","synonyms":["farm animal"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Animals & Wildlife","word":"horse","meaning":"a large animal often used for riding or farm work","translation":"ngựa","example":"Some tourists enjoy riding a horse in the countryside.","synonyms":["riding animal"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Animals & Wildlife","word":"dog","meaning":"a common domestic animal often kept as a pet","translation":"chó","example":"A dog needs regular exercise and care.","synonyms":["pet dog"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Animals & Wildlife","word":"cat","meaning":"a small domestic animal often kept as a pet","translation":"mèo","example":"Many people keep a cat because it can live comfortably indoors.","synonyms":["pet cat"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Animals & Wildlife","word":"fish species","meaning":"a particular type of fish","translation":"loài cá","example":"Pollution can reduce the number of fish species in a river.","synonyms":["type of fish"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Animals & Wildlife","word":"sea animal","meaning":"an animal that lives in the ocean","translation":"động vật biển","example":"Plastic waste can harm sea animals.","synonyms":["marine animal"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Animals & Wildlife","word":"wild bird","meaning":"a bird living naturally outside human care","translation":"chim hoang dã","example":"Wetlands provide food and shelter for many wild birds.","synonyms":["bird in nature"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Animals & Wildlife","word":"animal food","meaning":"food given to domestic or captive animals","translation":"thức ăn động vật","example":"Pet owners should choose suitable animal food.","synonyms":["pet food"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Animals & Wildlife","word":"feed an animal","meaning":"to give food to an animal","translation":"cho động vật ăn","example":"Visitors are asked not to feed animals in the zoo.","synonyms":["give food to an animal"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Animals & Wildlife","word":"protect animals","meaning":"to prevent animals from being harmed","translation":"bảo vệ động vật","example":"National laws can help protect animals from illegal hunting.","synonyms":["keep animals safe"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Animals & Wildlife","word":"animal population","meaning":"the number of animals of a species in an area","translation":"quần thể động vật","example":"The animal population increased after hunting was restricted.","synonyms":["number of animals"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Animals & Wildlife","word":"natural habitat","meaning":"the place where an animal or plant normally lives","translation":"môi trường sống tự nhiên","example":"Road building can destroy a natural habitat.","synonyms":["native habitat"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Animals & Wildlife","word":"wildlife park","meaning":"a protected or managed area where wild animals can live","translation":"công viên động vật hoang dã","example":"The wildlife park attracts visitors and supports conservation.","synonyms":["nature park"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Animals & Wildlife","word":"animal care","meaning":"the work of keeping animals healthy and safe","translation":"chăm sóc động vật","example":"Good animal care requires clean water and suitable food.","synonyms":["care for animals"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Weather & Climate","word":"sunny","meaning":"having bright sunlight and little cloud","translation":"có nắng","example":"Sunny weather encourages people to spend time outdoors.","synonyms":["bright"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Weather & Climate","word":"cloudy","meaning":"covered with clouds","translation":"nhiều mây","example":"The day was cloudy but dry.","synonyms":["overcast"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Weather & Climate","word":"windy","meaning":"having a lot of wind","translation":"nhiều gió","example":"It is often windy near the coast.","synonyms":["breezy"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Weather & Climate","word":"snow","meaning":"soft frozen water that falls from the sky","translation":"tuyết","example":"Heavy snow can close roads and airports.","synonyms":["snowfall"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Weather & Climate","word":"snowy","meaning":"having or covered with snow","translation":"có tuyết","example":"Snowy conditions make mountain roads dangerous.","synonyms":["covered in snow"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Weather & Climate","word":"strong wind","meaning":"wind moving with a lot of force","translation":"gió mạnh","example":"Strong winds can damage trees and buildings.","synonyms":["high wind"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Weather & Climate","word":"heavy rain","meaning":"rain falling in large amounts","translation":"mưa lớn","example":"Heavy rain may cause local flooding.","synonyms":["downpour"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Weather & Climate","word":"light rain","meaning":"rain falling in small amounts","translation":"mưa nhẹ","example":"Light rain continued throughout the morning.","synonyms":["drizzle"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Weather & Climate","word":"weather report","meaning":"information about expected weather conditions","translation":"bản tin thời tiết","example":"People check the weather report before outdoor events.","synonyms":["forecast report"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Weather & Climate","word":"weather condition","meaning":"a particular state of the weather","translation":"điều kiện thời tiết","example":"Poor weather conditions can delay flights.","synonyms":["weather state"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Weather & Climate","word":"warm weather","meaning":"weather with a comfortably high temperature","translation":"thời tiết ấm áp","example":"Warm weather attracts visitors to coastal areas.","synonyms":["mild weather"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Weather & Climate","word":"cool weather","meaning":"weather that is slightly cold","translation":"thời tiết mát mẻ","example":"Cool weather is often comfortable for walking.","synonyms":["mildly cold weather"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Weather & Climate","word":"change in temperature","meaning":"a rise or fall in how hot or cold something is","translation":"thay đổi nhiệt độ","example":"A sudden change in temperature can affect health.","synonyms":["temperature shift"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Weather & Climate","word":"rainy season","meaning":"the part of the year when most rain falls","translation":"mùa mưa","example":"Roads may flood during the rainy season.","synonyms":["wet season"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Weather & Climate","word":"dry season","meaning":"the part of the year with little rainfall","translation":"mùa khô","example":"Farmers may face water shortages in the dry season.","synonyms":["rain-free season"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Weather & Climate","word":"weather event","meaning":"a particular occurrence such as a storm or heatwave","translation":"hiện tượng thời tiết","example":"Extreme weather events can damage infrastructure.","synonyms":["weather occurrence"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Weather & Climate","word":"very hot day","meaning":"a day with unusually high temperatures","translation":"ngày rất nóng","example":"Older people need extra care on a very hot day.","synonyms":["hot day"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Weather & Climate","word":"weather change","meaning":"a difference in weather from one time to another","translation":"thay đổi thời tiết","example":"Rapid weather changes can make travel planning difficult.","synonyms":["change in conditions"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Daily Routines","word":"get dressed","meaning":"to put on clothes","translation":"mặc quần áo","example":"Most people get dressed soon after waking up.","synonyms":["put on clothes"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Daily Routines","word":"have breakfast","meaning":"to eat the first meal of the day","translation":"ăn sáng","example":"Students who have breakfast may concentrate better in class.","synonyms":["eat breakfast"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Daily Routines","word":"go to work","meaning":"to travel to one's workplace","translation":"đi làm","example":"Many commuters go to work before 8 a.m.","synonyms":["travel to work"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Daily Routines","word":"go to school","meaning":"to travel to or attend school","translation":"đi học","example":"Children often go to school by bus.","synonyms":["attend school"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Daily Routines","word":"come home","meaning":"to return to one's home","translation":"về nhà","example":"Office workers may come home late during busy periods.","synonyms":["return home"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Daily Routines","word":"do homework","meaning":"to complete school work outside class","translation":"làm bài tập về nhà","example":"Children usually do homework after dinner.","synonyms":["complete homework"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Daily Routines","word":"do the washing","meaning":"to clean clothes, usually in a washing machine","translation":"giặt quần áo","example":"Some families do the washing at weekends.","synonyms":["wash clothes"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Daily Routines","word":"clean the house","meaning":"to remove dirt and organise rooms at home","translation":"dọn nhà","example":"People often clean the house before visitors arrive.","synonyms":["do housework"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Daily Routines","word":"go shopping","meaning":"to visit shops to buy goods","translation":"đi mua sắm","example":"Families often go shopping for food once a week.","synonyms":["shop"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Daily Routines","word":"make dinner","meaning":"to prepare the evening meal","translation":"nấu bữa tối","example":"Parents may make dinner together after work.","synonyms":["cook dinner"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Daily Routines","word":"go to bed","meaning":"to get into bed to sleep","translation":"đi ngủ","example":"Children should go to bed at a regular time.","synonyms":["sleep"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Daily Routines","word":"set an alarm","meaning":"to programme a clock or phone to make a sound at a chosen time","translation":"đặt báo thức","example":"I set an alarm so I do not oversleep.","synonyms":["set a wake-up alert"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Daily Routines","word":"leave home","meaning":"to go out from one's house","translation":"rời khỏi nhà","example":"Commuters leave home earlier when traffic is heavy.","synonyms":["go out"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Daily Routines","word":"arrive on time","meaning":"to reach a place at the planned time","translation":"đến đúng giờ","example":"Employees are expected to arrive on time.","synonyms":["be punctual"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Daily Routines","word":"take a break","meaning":"to stop work or study for a short rest","translation":"nghỉ giải lao","example":"People should take a break after long periods at a screen.","synonyms":["have a rest"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Daily Routines","word":"plan the day","meaning":"to decide in advance how to use time during a day","translation":"lên kế hoạch trong ngày","example":"Planning the day can reduce stress.","synonyms":["organise the day"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Daily Routines","word":"finish work","meaning":"to complete one's working day","translation":"tan làm","example":"Many people exercise after they finish work.","synonyms":["end work"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Daily Routines","word":"morning routine","meaning":"the regular activities a person does after waking","translation":"thói quen buổi sáng","example":"A simple morning routine can help people start the day calmly.","synonyms":["daily morning habits"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"neighbourhood shop","meaning":"a small business serving people in a local area","translation":"cửa hàng khu phố","example":"A neighbourhood shop can be convenient for older residents.","synonyms":["local store"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"community event","meaning":"an organised activity for people living in the same area","translation":"sự kiện cộng đồng","example":"The community event brought neighbours together.","synonyms":["local event"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"local festival","meaning":"a celebration organised in a particular area","translation":"lễ hội địa phương","example":"A local festival can attract visitors and support small businesses.","synonyms":["community festival"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"local school","meaning":"a school serving children from a nearby area","translation":"trường địa phương","example":"The local school shares its sports field with residents.","synonyms":["neighbourhood school"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"sports centre","meaning":"a building with facilities for exercise and sport","translation":"trung tâm thể thao","example":"The sports centre offers low-cost swimming lessons.","synonyms":["leisure centre"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"playground","meaning":"an outdoor area where children can play","translation":"sân chơi","example":"Families want a safe playground near their homes.","synonyms":["children's play area"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"bus service","meaning":"a system of buses operating on routes for passengers","translation":"dịch vụ xe buýt","example":"A reliable bus service helps residents without cars.","synonyms":["public bus service"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"local business","meaning":"a company or shop operating in a local area","translation":"doanh nghiệp địa phương","example":"Residents can support a local business by shopping nearby.","synonyms":["neighbourhood business"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"community group","meaning":"an organisation formed by local people for a shared purpose","translation":"nhóm cộng đồng","example":"The community group organises weekly activities for seniors.","synonyms":["local organisation"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"meet neighbours","meaning":"to spend time talking or socialising with people living nearby","translation":"gặp gỡ hàng xóm","example":"Public spaces give residents chances to meet neighbours.","synonyms":["socialise locally"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"help a neighbour","meaning":"to give practical or emotional support to someone living nearby","translation":"giúp hàng xóm","example":"People may help a neighbour who is elderly or unwell.","synonyms":["support a neighbour"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"friendly area","meaning":"a place where residents are welcoming and sociable","translation":"khu vực thân thiện","example":"Families enjoy living in a friendly area.","synonyms":["welcoming neighbourhood"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"safe community","meaning":"a local area with low danger and strong social support","translation":"cộng đồng an toàn","example":"Good lighting and active residents can create a safe community.","synonyms":["secure community"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"local problem","meaning":"a difficulty affecting a particular neighbourhood","translation":"vấn đề địa phương","example":"Residents met the council to discuss a local problem.","synonyms":["community issue"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"local solution","meaning":"an action designed to solve a problem in a nearby area","translation":"giải pháp địa phương","example":"A local solution may be more practical than a national programme.","synonyms":["community solution"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"community support","meaning":"help provided by people or organisations in a local area","translation":"hỗ trợ cộng đồng","example":"Community support is important for isolated residents.","synonyms":["local assistance"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"shared space","meaning":"an area used by many people for different activities","translation":"không gian chung","example":"A shared space should be clean and accessible.","synonyms":["communal area"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"local improvement","meaning":"a change that makes a neighbourhood better","translation":"cải thiện địa phương","example":"New street lights were a useful local improvement.","synonyms":["community improvement"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"national holiday","meaning":"an official holiday celebrated across a country","translation":"ngày lễ quốc gia","example":"Many families travel during a national holiday.","synonyms":["public holiday"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"traditional dress","meaning":"clothing connected with a culture or tradition","translation":"trang phục truyền thống","example":"People may wear traditional dress during festivals.","synonyms":["traditional clothing"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"traditional music","meaning":"music passed through generations within a culture","translation":"âm nhạc truyền thống","example":"Traditional music is performed at local celebrations.","synonyms":["folk music style"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"traditional dance","meaning":"a form of dance associated with a culture or community","translation":"điệu múa truyền thống","example":"Visitors watched a traditional dance at the festival.","synonyms":["folk dance"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"family tradition","meaning":"a custom regularly followed within a family","translation":"truyền thống gia đình","example":"Cooking together is an important family tradition for some households.","synonyms":["family custom"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"local tradition","meaning":"a custom practised in a particular area","translation":"truyền thống địa phương","example":"The local tradition has continued for several generations.","synonyms":["regional custom"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"special occasion","meaning":"an important event or celebration","translation":"dịp đặc biệt","example":"People often prepare special food for a special occasion.","synonyms":["important event"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"celebrate a birthday","meaning":"to mark the anniversary of a person's birth","translation":"mừng sinh nhật","example":"Families celebrate a birthday in different ways.","synonyms":["mark a birthday"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"give a gift","meaning":"to present something to another person without payment","translation":"tặng quà","example":"People often give a gift during important celebrations.","synonyms":["present a gift"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"wear traditional clothes","meaning":"to dress in clothing associated with a culture","translation":"mặc trang phục truyền thống","example":"Some students wear traditional clothes on cultural days.","synonyms":["dress traditionally"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"visit a temple","meaning":"to go to a religious or cultural place of worship","translation":"đi thăm đền chùa","example":"Tourists should behave respectfully when they visit a temple.","synonyms":["visit a place of worship"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"cultural event","meaning":"an activity that presents or celebrates arts and traditions","translation":"sự kiện văn hóa","example":"The city organises a cultural event every spring.","synonyms":["culture event"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"cultural difference","meaning":"a difference in customs, beliefs or behaviour between groups","translation":"khác biệt văn hóa","example":"Travel can help people understand cultural differences.","synonyms":["difference in culture"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"respect a tradition","meaning":"to value and follow an established cultural practice","translation":"tôn trọng truyền thống","example":"Young people can modernise while still respecting traditions.","synonyms":["honour a custom"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"local culture","meaning":"the customs, arts and way of life of a particular area","translation":"văn hóa địa phương","example":"Tourism can introduce visitors to local culture.","synonyms":["regional culture"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"cultural activity","meaning":"an activity connected with art, customs or heritage","translation":"hoạt động văn hóa","example":"Museums often organise cultural activities for children.","synonyms":["culture-related activity"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"festival food","meaning":"food traditionally eaten during a celebration","translation":"món ăn lễ hội","example":"Festival food often reflects local history.","synonyms":["celebration food"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"traditional game","meaning":"a game passed down through generations","translation":"trò chơi truyền thống","example":"Traditional games are often played during community festivals.","synonyms":["folk game"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Reading & Hobbies","word":"novel","meaning":"a long fictional book","translation":"tiểu thuyết","example":"Reading a novel can help learners meet vocabulary in context.","synonyms":["fiction book"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Reading & Hobbies","word":"comic","meaning":"a publication containing stories told through pictures and text","translation":"truyện tranh","example":"Comics can encourage reluctant readers to read more.","synonyms":["comic book"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Reading & Hobbies","word":"poem","meaning":"a piece of writing arranged to express ideas or feelings creatively","translation":"bài thơ","example":"Students sometimes memorise a poem for class.","synonyms":["verse"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Reading & Hobbies","word":"library book","meaning":"a book borrowed from a library","translation":"sách thư viện","example":"Readers should return a library book on time.","synonyms":["borrowed book"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Reading & Hobbies","word":"read online","meaning":"to read digital text on a website or device","translation":"đọc trực tuyến","example":"Many students read online instead of buying printed material.","synonyms":["read digitally"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Reading & Hobbies","word":"listen to music","meaning":"to spend time hearing songs or other musical works","translation":"nghe nhạc","example":"People often listen to music while travelling.","synonyms":["hear music"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Reading & Hobbies","word":"watch a film","meaning":"to view a movie for entertainment or study","translation":"xem phim","example":"Families may watch a film together at weekends.","synonyms":["see a movie"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Reading & Hobbies","word":"play music","meaning":"to perform music on an instrument or device","translation":"chơi nhạc","example":"Learning to play music can require regular practice.","synonyms":["perform music"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Reading & Hobbies","word":"draw","meaning":"to make a picture using lines with a pen or pencil","translation":"vẽ","example":"Children often draw to express ideas visually.","synonyms":["sketch"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Reading & Hobbies","word":"take photos","meaning":"to use a camera or phone to create photographs","translation":"chụp ảnh","example":"Travellers often take photos of landscapes.","synonyms":["photograph"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Reading & Hobbies","word":"play an instrument","meaning":"to make music using a musical instrument","translation":"chơi nhạc cụ","example":"Learning to play an instrument can improve concentration.","synonyms":["perform on an instrument"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Reading & Hobbies","word":"free-time activity","meaning":"something done for enjoyment when not working or studying","translation":"hoạt động lúc rảnh","example":"Reading is an inexpensive free-time activity.","synonyms":["leisure activity"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Reading & Hobbies","word":"favourite hobby","meaning":"the activity a person most enjoys in their spare time","translation":"sở thích yêu thích","example":"Her favourite hobby is landscape photography.","synonyms":["preferred pastime"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Reading & Hobbies","word":"creative hobby","meaning":"a leisure activity involving imagination or making things","translation":"sở thích sáng tạo","example":"Painting is a creative hobby that can reduce stress.","synonyms":["creative pastime"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Reading & Hobbies","word":"join a club","meaning":"to become a member of an organised social or activity group","translation":"tham gia câu lạc bộ","example":"Students can join a club to meet people with similar interests.","synonyms":["become a club member"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Reading & Hobbies","word":"borrow a book","meaning":"to take a book temporarily and return it later","translation":"mượn sách","example":"People can borrow a book for free from a public library.","synonyms":["take a book on loan"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Reading & Hobbies","word":"recommend a book","meaning":"to suggest that someone should read a particular book","translation":"giới thiệu sách","example":"Teachers often recommend a book related to a class topic.","synonyms":["suggest a book"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Reading & Hobbies","word":"spend free time","meaning":"to use time when not working or studying","translation":"dành thời gian rảnh","example":"Young people spend free time in many different ways.","synonyms":["use leisure time"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Shopping & Services","word":"clothes shop","meaning":"a store that sells clothing","translation":"cửa hàng quần áo","example":"The clothes shop offers student discounts.","synonyms":["fashion store"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Shopping & Services","word":"bookshop","meaning":"a store that sells books","translation":"hiệu sách","example":"Independent bookshops can support local cultural life.","synonyms":["bookstore"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Shopping & Services","word":"pharmacy","meaning":"a shop where medicines and health products are sold","translation":"nhà thuốc","example":"People can buy basic medicine at a pharmacy.","synonyms":["drugstore"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Shopping & Services","word":"bakery","meaning":"a shop that makes or sells bread and cakes","translation":"tiệm bánh","example":"The bakery employs several local workers.","synonyms":["bread shop"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Shopping & Services","word":"barber","meaning":"a person or shop that cuts hair, especially men's hair","translation":"thợ cắt tóc, tiệm cắt tóc","example":"The local barber has served the neighbourhood for years.","synonyms":["hairdresser"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Shopping & Services","word":"hair salon","meaning":"a business where people have their hair cut or styled","translation":"tiệm làm tóc","example":"A hair salon usually requires an appointment at busy times.","synonyms":["hairdresser's"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Shopping & Services","word":"customer service","meaning":"help and advice provided by a business to its customers","translation":"dịch vụ khách hàng","example":"Good customer service can build loyalty.","synonyms":["client support"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Shopping & Services","word":"shop assistant","meaning":"a person who helps customers in a store","translation":"nhân viên bán hàng","example":"The shop assistant helped me find the correct size.","synonyms":["sales assistant"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Shopping & Services","word":"opening hours","meaning":"the times during which a business is open","translation":"giờ mở cửa","example":"Customers can check opening hours online.","synonyms":["business hours"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Shopping & Services","word":"close early","meaning":"to stop business earlier than usual","translation":"đóng cửa sớm","example":"Some local shops close early on Sundays.","synonyms":["shut early"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Shopping & Services","word":"home delivery","meaning":"a service that brings purchased goods to a person's home","translation":"giao hàng tận nhà","example":"Home delivery is useful for elderly customers.","synonyms":["delivery service"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Shopping & Services","word":"pay by card","meaning":"to make a payment using a bank or credit card","translation":"thanh toán bằng thẻ","example":"Most supermarkets allow customers to pay by card.","synonyms":["use a card"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Shopping & Services","word":"pay in cash","meaning":"to make a payment using notes or coins","translation":"thanh toán tiền mặt","example":"Some markets still require customers to pay in cash.","synonyms":["use cash"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Shopping & Services","word":"out of stock","meaning":"not currently available for sale","translation":"hết hàng","example":"Popular products may be out of stock during a sale.","synonyms":["unavailable"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Shopping & Services","word":"in stock","meaning":"currently available to buy","translation":"còn hàng","example":"The website shows whether an item is in stock.","synonyms":["available"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Shopping & Services","word":"exchange an item","meaning":"to return a product and receive another one instead","translation":"đổi hàng","example":"Customers can exchange an item if they have the receipt.","synonyms":["swap a product"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Shopping & Services","word":"refund","meaning":"money returned to a customer after a purchase is cancelled or returned","translation":"hoàn tiền","example":"The company offered a full refund for the faulty product.","synonyms":["money back"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Shopping & Services","word":"service quality","meaning":"the standard of help or work provided by a business","translation":"chất lượng dịch vụ","example":"Service quality strongly affects customer satisfaction.","synonyms":["quality of service"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"academic year","meaning":"the period of the year when a university or school provides classes","translation":"năm học","example":"Universities often divide the academic year into two semesters.","synonyms":["school year"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"admission requirements","meaning":"the conditions applicants must meet to enter a course or institution","translation":"điều kiện tuyển sinh","example":"Admission requirements vary between universities and programmes.","synonyms":["entry requirements"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"entrance exam","meaning":"a test used to select applicants for a school or university","translation":"kỳ thi đầu vào","example":"Some universities require students to pass an entrance exam.","synonyms":["admission test"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"lecture","meaning":"a formal educational talk given to a large group of students","translation":"bài giảng","example":"Students are expected to take notes during a lecture.","synonyms":["academic talk"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"seminar","meaning":"a small academic class based on discussion","translation":"buổi hội thảo học thuật","example":"Seminars give students more opportunities to ask questions.","synonyms":["discussion class"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"tutorial","meaning":"a small teaching session with individual or group guidance","translation":"buổi hướng dẫn học tập","example":"The weekly tutorial focused on essay planning.","synonyms":["guided class"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"assignment","meaning":"a piece of work students must complete for a course","translation":"bài tập được giao","example":"Each assignment contributes to the final grade.","synonyms":["coursework task"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"dissertation","meaning":"a long piece of academic research written for a degree","translation":"luận văn","example":"Postgraduate students may spend months writing a dissertation.","synonyms":["thesis"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"major","meaning":"the main subject studied by a university student","translation":"chuyên ngành","example":"She chose economics as her university major.","synonyms":["field of study"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"degree programme","meaning":"a structured course of university study leading to a degree","translation":"chương trình đại học","example":"The degree programme combines theory with practical training.","synonyms":["university course"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"student loan","meaning":"money borrowed to pay for education and repaid later","translation":"khoản vay sinh viên","example":"High tuition can force students to rely on a student loan.","synonyms":["education loan"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"academic pressure","meaning":"stress caused by expectations and demands related to study","translation":"áp lực học tập","example":"Academic pressure can affect students' mental health.","synonyms":["study pressure"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"study abroad","meaning":"to complete part or all of one's education in another country","translation":"du học","example":"Many students study abroad to gain international experience.","synonyms":["overseas study"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"exchange programme","meaning":"an arrangement allowing students to study temporarily at another institution","translation":"chương trình trao đổi","example":"An exchange programme can improve language skills and cultural awareness.","synonyms":["student exchange"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"graduate employment","meaning":"paid work obtained by people after completing university","translation":"việc làm sau tốt nghiệp","example":"Universities increasingly publish data on graduate employment.","synonyms":["employment after graduation"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"academic achievement","meaning":"success measured through grades, qualifications or educational progress","translation":"thành tích học tập","example":"Sleep quality can influence academic achievement.","synonyms":["educational success"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"independent study","meaning":"learning carried out by a student without constant teacher supervision","translation":"tự học","example":"University courses require a great deal of independent study.","synonyms":["self-directed learning"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"research project","meaning":"a planned investigation designed to answer an academic question","translation":"dự án nghiên cứu","example":"Students completed a research project on urban transport.","synonyms":["academic project"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"practical training","meaning":"hands-on instruction that develops skills for real situations","translation":"đào tạo thực hành","example":"Nursing courses include extensive practical training.","synonyms":["hands-on training"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"course content","meaning":"the topics and material taught in an educational programme","translation":"nội dung khóa học","example":"Employers sometimes argue that course content should reflect workplace needs.","synonyms":["curriculum content"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"academic support","meaning":"help provided to students with study, writing or learning difficulties","translation":"hỗ trợ học tập","example":"Academic support can reduce dropout rates among first-year students.","synonyms":["study support"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"drop out of university","meaning":"to leave university before completing a course","translation":"bỏ học đại học","example":"Financial difficulties may cause some students to drop out of university.","synonyms":["leave university early"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"complete a degree","meaning":"to finish all requirements for a university qualification","translation":"hoàn thành bằng đại học","example":"Many students work part-time while they complete a degree.","synonyms":["graduate"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"academic skills","meaning":"abilities needed for successful study, such as research and critical reading","translation":"kỹ năng học thuật","example":"First-year courses often teach basic academic skills.","synonyms":["study skills"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Higher Education","word":"career prospects","meaning":"the future opportunities a person has for employment and advancement","translation":"triển vọng nghề nghiệp","example":"Students often consider career prospects when choosing a major.","synonyms":["employment prospects"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"annual leave","meaning":"paid time away from work provided each year","translation":"nghỉ phép năm","example":"Employees value jobs that offer enough annual leave.","synonyms":["paid holiday allowance"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"sick leave","meaning":"time away from work because of illness","translation":"nghỉ ốm","example":"Workers should be able to take sick leave without losing their jobs.","synonyms":["medical leave"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"maternity leave","meaning":"time away from work for a mother around childbirth","translation":"nghỉ thai sản","example":"Paid maternity leave can support maternal and child health.","synonyms":["parental leave for mothers"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"paternity leave","meaning":"time away from work for a father after a child is born","translation":"nghỉ thai sản cho cha","example":"Paternity leave allows fathers to take a larger role in early childcare.","synonyms":["father's leave"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"overtime","meaning":"extra working time beyond normal hours","translation":"làm thêm giờ","example":"Regular overtime may lead to stress and burnout.","synonyms":["extra hours"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"performance review","meaning":"a formal assessment of an employee's work","translation":"đánh giá hiệu suất","example":"A performance review can identify training needs.","synonyms":["staff appraisal"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"staff turnover","meaning":"the rate at which employees leave and are replaced","translation":"tỷ lệ thay đổi nhân sự","example":"Poor management often leads to high staff turnover.","synonyms":["employee turnover"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"workplace culture","meaning":"the shared values and behaviour within an organisation","translation":"văn hóa nơi làm việc","example":"A supportive workplace culture can improve retention.","synonyms":["organisational culture"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"team leader","meaning":"a person responsible for guiding a small work group","translation":"trưởng nhóm","example":"The team leader coordinates tasks and deadlines.","synonyms":["team supervisor"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"job applicant","meaning":"a person who formally applies for a position","translation":"ứng viên xin việc","example":"Each job applicant must submit a CV and cover letter.","synonyms":["candidate"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"job vacancy","meaning":"an available position that an employer wants to fill","translation":"vị trí tuyển dụng","example":"The company advertised a new job vacancy online.","synonyms":["open position"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"employment contract","meaning":"a legal agreement between an employer and employee","translation":"hợp đồng lao động","example":"Workers should read an employment contract carefully before signing.","synonyms":["work contract"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"permanent job","meaning":"employment without a fixed end date","translation":"việc làm lâu dài","example":"Many graduates prefer the security of a permanent job.","synonyms":["permanent position"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"temporary job","meaning":"employment that lasts for a limited period","translation":"việc làm tạm thời","example":"Seasonal industries often rely on temporary jobs.","synonyms":["short-term position"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"freelance work","meaning":"paid work done independently for different clients","translation":"công việc tự do","example":"Freelance work offers flexibility but may provide less security.","synonyms":["independent work"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"professional development","meaning":"training and learning that improve career-related skills","translation":"phát triển chuyên môn","example":"Employers can support staff through professional development.","synonyms":["career development"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"workplace stress","meaning":"pressure and anxiety caused by job demands","translation":"căng thẳng nơi làm việc","example":"Heavy workloads are a common source of workplace stress.","synonyms":["job stress"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"career progression","meaning":"movement towards more senior or skilled positions","translation":"sự thăng tiến nghề nghiệp","example":"Clear promotion criteria can support career progression.","synonyms":["career advancement"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"employee benefits","meaning":"non-salary rewards such as insurance, leave or pensions","translation":"phúc lợi nhân viên","example":"Employee benefits can make a job more attractive.","synonyms":["staff benefits"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"competitive salary","meaning":"pay that is similar to or better than comparable jobs","translation":"mức lương cạnh tranh","example":"A competitive salary helps firms recruit skilled workers.","synonyms":["attractive pay"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"job-related skills","meaning":"abilities directly useful for a particular occupation","translation":"kỹ năng nghề nghiệp","example":"Vocational courses focus heavily on job-related skills.","synonyms":["work skills"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"workplace communication","meaning":"the exchange of information among people at work","translation":"giao tiếp nơi làm việc","example":"Good workplace communication reduces mistakes and conflict.","synonyms":["professional communication"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"meet a deadline","meaning":"to finish work by the required time","translation":"đáp ứng thời hạn","example":"Employees may need to prioritise tasks to meet a deadline.","synonyms":["finish on time"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"career change","meaning":"a move from one occupation or field to another","translation":"chuyển nghề","example":"Automation may encourage some workers to make a career change.","synonyms":["change profession"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Employment & Workplace","word":"employment conditions","meaning":"the pay, hours, rights and environment associated with a job","translation":"điều kiện lao động","example":"Governments set minimum standards for employment conditions.","synonyms":["working conditions"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"health campaign","meaning":"an organised effort to improve public knowledge or behaviour about health","translation":"chiến dịch sức khỏe","example":"A health campaign can encourage people to stop smoking.","synonyms":["public-health campaign"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"health screening","meaning":"medical tests used to identify disease before symptoms become severe","translation":"sàng lọc sức khỏe","example":"Regular health screening can support early diagnosis.","synonyms":["medical screening"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"early diagnosis","meaning":"identifying a disease at an early stage","translation":"chẩn đoán sớm","example":"Early diagnosis often improves treatment outcomes.","synonyms":["early detection"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"medical treatment","meaning":"care provided to cure or manage illness","translation":"điều trị y tế","example":"Access to medical treatment should not depend only on income.","synonyms":["healthcare treatment"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"prescription medicine","meaning":"medicine legally supplied on the instruction of a doctor","translation":"thuốc kê đơn","example":"Prescription medicine should be used only as directed.","synonyms":["prescribed drug"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"health insurance","meaning":"financial protection that helps pay for medical care","translation":"bảo hiểm y tế","example":"Health insurance reduces the risk of large medical bills.","synonyms":["medical insurance"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"health service","meaning":"an organisation or system that provides healthcare","translation":"dịch vụ y tế","example":"Rural communities may have limited access to health services.","synonyms":["healthcare service"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"medical facility","meaning":"a place where healthcare is provided","translation":"cơ sở y tế","example":"Remote regions often lack advanced medical facilities.","synonyms":["healthcare facility"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"health risk","meaning":"something that increases the chance of illness or injury","translation":"nguy cơ sức khỏe","example":"Air pollution is a major health risk in many cities.","synonyms":["health hazard"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"risk factor","meaning":"a characteristic or behaviour that raises the likelihood of disease","translation":"yếu tố nguy cơ","example":"Smoking is a well-known risk factor for lung disease.","synonyms":["contributing risk"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"healthy ageing","meaning":"maintaining physical and mental well-being in later life","translation":"lão hóa khỏe mạnh","example":"Regular exercise supports healthy ageing.","synonyms":["active ageing"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"public-health policy","meaning":"government policy designed to protect or improve population health","translation":"chính sách y tế công cộng","example":"Taxes on tobacco are one form of public-health policy.","synonyms":["health policy"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"disease control","meaning":"measures used to reduce the spread or impact of illness","translation":"kiểm soát bệnh tật","example":"Vaccination remains central to infectious disease control.","synonyms":["illness control"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"infectious disease","meaning":"an illness that can spread between people or organisms","translation":"bệnh truyền nhiễm","example":"International travel can accelerate the spread of infectious disease.","synonyms":["communicable disease"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"health education","meaning":"teaching people how to protect and improve their health","translation":"giáo dục sức khỏe","example":"Schools can provide health education on diet and exercise.","synonyms":["health awareness education"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"exercise programme","meaning":"an organised plan of physical activity","translation":"chương trình tập luyện","example":"Workplaces may offer an exercise programme to improve staff well-being.","synonyms":["fitness programme"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"sugar intake","meaning":"the amount of sugar a person consumes","translation":"lượng đường tiêu thụ","example":"Reducing sugar intake can lower the risk of obesity.","synonyms":["sugar consumption"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"smoking rate","meaning":"the proportion of a population that smokes","translation":"tỷ lệ hút thuốc","example":"Public bans have helped reduce the smoking rate in some countries.","synonyms":["rate of tobacco use"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"unequal health access","meaning":"differences between groups in their ability to obtain healthcare","translation":"tiếp cận y tế không bình đẳng","example":"Unequal health access is often more severe in remote and low-income areas.","synonyms":["healthcare access disparity"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"health outcome","meaning":"the result of healthcare, behaviour or conditions on a person's health","translation":"kết quả sức khỏe","example":"Early treatment can improve long-term health outcomes.","synonyms":["medical outcome"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"patient care","meaning":"the treatment, support and attention given to patients","translation":"chăm sóc bệnh nhân","example":"Hospitals need enough nurses to maintain good patient care.","synonyms":["clinical care"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"emergency care","meaning":"urgent medical treatment for serious illness or injury","translation":"chăm sóc cấp cứu","example":"Rural areas need reliable access to emergency care.","synonyms":["urgent care"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"healthcare worker","meaning":"a person employed to provide medical or health services","translation":"nhân viên y tế","example":"Healthcare workers require continuous training.","synonyms":["medical worker"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"preventable disease","meaning":"an illness that can often be avoided through effective measures","translation":"bệnh có thể phòng ngừa","example":"Vaccination can reduce deaths from preventable diseases.","synonyms":["avoidable disease"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Public Health","word":"quality of care","meaning":"the standard of medical treatment and support provided","translation":"chất lượng chăm sóc","example":"Patient safety is an important part of quality of care.","synonyms":["care quality"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"online identity","meaning":"the information and image a person presents on the internet","translation":"danh tính trực tuyến","example":"Young people may carefully manage their online identity.","synonyms":["digital identity"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"social networking","meaning":"using online platforms to connect and communicate with others","translation":"mạng lưới xã hội trực tuyến","example":"Social networking has changed how people maintain friendships.","synonyms":["online networking"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"online community","meaning":"a group of people who interact mainly through the internet","translation":"cộng đồng trực tuyến","example":"An online community can provide support for people with shared interests.","synonyms":["digital community"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"instant messaging","meaning":"real-time text communication through internet services","translation":"nhắn tin tức thời","example":"Instant messaging is common in both social and work settings.","synonyms":["real-time messaging"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"video conferencing","meaning":"holding meetings through live online video","translation":"hội nghị truyền hình","example":"Video conferencing reduces the need for business travel.","synonyms":["online meetings"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"online privacy","meaning":"the protection of personal information and activities on the internet","translation":"quyền riêng tư trực tuyến","example":"Users should understand the settings that control online privacy.","synonyms":["internet privacy"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"privacy settings","meaning":"controls that determine who can see a user's information","translation":"cài đặt quyền riêng tư","example":"Teenagers should review their privacy settings regularly.","synonyms":["access controls"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"online safety","meaning":"practices that protect users from digital risks","translation":"an toàn trực tuyến","example":"Schools increasingly teach online safety.","synonyms":["internet safety"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"digital distraction","meaning":"loss of attention caused by devices, apps or notifications","translation":"sự xao nhãng kỹ thuật số","example":"Constant notifications can create digital distraction during study.","synonyms":["online distraction"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"information sharing","meaning":"the exchange or publication of information between people or systems","translation":"chia sẻ thông tin","example":"Social media makes information sharing extremely fast.","synonyms":["data sharing"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"online behaviour","meaning":"the way people act and communicate on the internet","translation":"hành vi trực tuyến","example":"Schools can teach respectful online behaviour.","synonyms":["digital behaviour"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"social-media use","meaning":"the amount and manner in which people use social networks","translation":"việc sử dụng mạng xã hội","example":"Heavy social-media use may affect sleep quality.","synonyms":["use of social networks"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"online reputation","meaning":"the public image of a person or organisation on the internet","translation":"danh tiếng trực tuyến","example":"Careless posts can damage a person's online reputation.","synonyms":["digital reputation"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"internet user","meaning":"a person who regularly accesses the internet","translation":"người dùng internet","example":"Internet users need basic skills to evaluate sources.","synonyms":["web user"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"online account","meaning":"a personal profile used to access an internet service","translation":"tài khoản trực tuyến","example":"Users should protect each online account with a unique password.","synonyms":["digital account"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"subscription service","meaning":"an online or offline service paid for regularly","translation":"dịch vụ đăng ký","example":"Streaming platforms often operate as a subscription service.","synonyms":["paid membership service"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"digital content","meaning":"text, audio, images or video produced in electronic form","translation":"nội dung số","example":"Young people consume large amounts of digital content.","synonyms":["online content"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"online advertising","meaning":"advertising delivered through websites, apps or social media","translation":"quảng cáo trực tuyến","example":"Online advertising can be targeted using user data.","synonyms":["digital advertising"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"internet addiction","meaning":"problematic and excessive use of online services","translation":"nghiện internet","example":"Internet addiction can interfere with study and relationships.","synonyms":["problematic internet use"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"fact-check online","meaning":"to verify whether online information is accurate","translation":"kiểm chứng thông tin trực tuyến","example":"Users should fact-check online claims before sharing them.","synonyms":["verify online"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"share personal information","meaning":"to provide private details to other people or services","translation":"chia sẻ thông tin cá nhân","example":"Children should be careful when sharing personal information online.","synonyms":["disclose personal data"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"online scam","meaning":"a dishonest internet scheme designed to steal money or information","translation":"lừa đảo trực tuyến","example":"Older users may be vulnerable to sophisticated online scams.","synonyms":["internet fraud"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"digital skill","meaning":"an ability needed to use digital devices and services effectively","translation":"kỹ năng số","example":"Basic digital skills are necessary for many jobs.","synonyms":["technology skill"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"online resource","meaning":"information or material available through the internet","translation":"tài nguyên trực tuyến","example":"Students can access free online resources for language practice.","synonyms":["web resource"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Digital Life & Social Media","word":"screen-based activity","meaning":"an activity done using a phone, computer or television screen","translation":"hoạt động trên màn hình","example":"Too much screen-based activity may reduce physical exercise.","synonyms":["screen activity"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"air quality","meaning":"the degree to which air is clean and safe to breathe","translation":"chất lượng không khí","example":"Traffic emissions can reduce urban air quality.","synonyms":["quality of the air"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"water pollution","meaning":"contamination of rivers, lakes or seas by harmful substances","translation":"ô nhiễm nước","example":"Untreated industrial waste contributes to water pollution.","synonyms":["water contamination"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"air pollution","meaning":"harmful substances present in the atmosphere","translation":"ô nhiễm không khí","example":"Air pollution is linked to respiratory disease.","synonyms":["atmospheric pollution"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"plastic waste","meaning":"discarded plastic material","translation":"rác thải nhựa","example":"Plastic waste can remain in the environment for decades.","synonyms":["plastic rubbish"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"household waste","meaning":"rubbish produced by homes","translation":"rác thải sinh hoạt","example":"Cities need efficient systems for collecting household waste.","synonyms":["domestic waste"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"industrial waste","meaning":"unwanted material produced by factories and industry","translation":"chất thải công nghiệp","example":"Industrial waste must be treated before disposal.","synonyms":["factory waste"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"waste management","meaning":"the collection, treatment and disposal of waste","translation":"quản lý chất thải","example":"Effective waste management reduces environmental damage.","synonyms":["waste control"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"renewable source","meaning":"an energy source that can naturally be replaced","translation":"nguồn năng lượng tái tạo","example":"Solar power is a widely available renewable source.","synonyms":["renewable resource"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"non-renewable resource","meaning":"a natural resource that is used faster than it can be replaced","translation":"tài nguyên không tái tạo","example":"Coal is a non-renewable resource with high carbon emissions.","synonyms":["finite resource"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"solar energy","meaning":"energy produced from sunlight","translation":"năng lượng mặt trời","example":"Solar energy can reduce dependence on fossil fuels.","synonyms":["solar power"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"wind energy","meaning":"energy generated using moving air","translation":"năng lượng gió","example":"Coastal regions may have strong potential for wind energy.","synonyms":["wind power"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"energy consumption","meaning":"the amount of energy used by people, buildings or industry","translation":"mức tiêu thụ năng lượng","example":"Better insulation can reduce household energy consumption.","synonyms":["energy use"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"energy demand","meaning":"the amount of energy required by users or an economy","translation":"nhu cầu năng lượng","example":"Population growth can increase national energy demand.","synonyms":["demand for energy"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"carbon dioxide","meaning":"a greenhouse gas produced naturally and through human activities","translation":"khí carbon dioxide","example":"Burning coal releases large amounts of carbon dioxide.","synonyms":["CO2"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"environmental awareness","meaning":"understanding of environmental problems and responsible behaviour","translation":"nhận thức môi trường","example":"Schools can increase environmental awareness among children.","synonyms":["green awareness"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"environmental protection","meaning":"actions and policies intended to protect nature","translation":"bảo vệ môi trường","example":"Environmental protection requires both regulation and public cooperation.","synonyms":["conservation action"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"conserve resources","meaning":"to use natural materials carefully and avoid waste","translation":"bảo tồn tài nguyên","example":"Households can conserve resources by repairing and reusing goods.","synonyms":["save resources"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"reduce emissions","meaning":"to lower the amount of gases released into the atmosphere","translation":"giảm khí thải","example":"Cities can reduce emissions by improving public transport.","synonyms":["cut emissions"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"recycling rate","meaning":"the proportion of waste that is recycled","translation":"tỷ lệ tái chế","example":"Deposit schemes can increase the recycling rate.","synonyms":["rate of recycling"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"green technology","meaning":"technology designed to reduce environmental harm","translation":"công nghệ xanh","example":"Investment in green technology may create new industries.","synonyms":["clean technology"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"single-use plastic","meaning":"plastic designed to be used once before disposal","translation":"nhựa dùng một lần","example":"Many governments are restricting single-use plastic.","synonyms":["disposable plastic"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"waste reduction","meaning":"the process of producing or throwing away less waste","translation":"giảm chất thải","example":"Packaging rules can encourage waste reduction.","synonyms":["reducing waste"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"environmental damage","meaning":"harm caused to ecosystems, air, water or land","translation":"thiệt hại môi trường","example":"Mining can cause serious environmental damage without regulation.","synonyms":["ecological harm"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"protect natural resources","meaning":"to prevent unnecessary depletion or damage to natural materials","translation":"bảo vệ tài nguyên thiên nhiên","example":"Governments need long-term policies to protect natural resources.","synonyms":["conserve natural resources"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Environment & Energy","word":"clean energy","meaning":"energy that causes little pollution or greenhouse-gas emission","translation":"năng lượng sạch","example":"Clean energy investment is growing in many countries.","synonyms":["low-pollution energy"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"urban population","meaning":"the number of people living in towns and cities","translation":"dân số đô thị","example":"The urban population has grown rapidly in developing economies.","synonyms":["city population"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"population concentration","meaning":"the degree to which people are concentrated within particular areas","translation":"mức độ tập trung dân số","example":"High population concentration can increase demand for housing and transport.","synonyms":["concentration of population"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"housing demand","meaning":"the number of homes people want or need","translation":"nhu cầu nhà ở","example":"Migration to cities has increased housing demand.","synonyms":["demand for homes"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"rental market","meaning":"the system in which homes are offered for rent","translation":"thị trường cho thuê","example":"Young adults are strongly affected by changes in the rental market.","synonyms":["housing rental sector"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"rent prices","meaning":"the amounts people must pay to rent homes","translation":"giá thuê nhà","example":"Rent prices have risen faster than wages in some cities.","synonyms":["rental costs"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"home ownership","meaning":"the condition of owning the home in which one lives","translation":"sở hữu nhà","example":"High prices make home ownership difficult for young families.","synonyms":["owning a home"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"housing development","meaning":"a project in which new homes are built","translation":"dự án phát triển nhà ở","example":"The council approved a large housing development near the station.","synonyms":["residential development"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"high-rise building","meaning":"a tall building with many floors","translation":"tòa nhà cao tầng","example":"High-rise buildings can accommodate more residents on limited land.","synonyms":["tower block"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"urban area","meaning":"a city or town and its developed surroundings","translation":"khu vực đô thị","example":"Jobs and services are concentrated in urban areas.","synonyms":["built-up area"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"urban growth","meaning":"the expansion of cities in population or physical size","translation":"tăng trưởng đô thị","example":"Unplanned urban growth can create transport problems.","synonyms":["city growth"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"rural community","meaning":"a group of people living in the countryside","translation":"cộng đồng nông thôn","example":"Rural communities may struggle to retain young workers.","synonyms":["village community"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"city services","meaning":"public or private services needed by urban residents","translation":"dịch vụ đô thị","example":"Rapid growth places pressure on city services.","synonyms":["urban services"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"basic infrastructure","meaning":"essential systems such as roads, water and electricity","translation":"hạ tầng cơ bản","example":"New housing requires investment in basic infrastructure.","synonyms":["essential infrastructure"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"housing policy","meaning":"government rules and programmes related to homes and affordability","translation":"chính sách nhà ở","example":"Housing policy can influence rents and construction.","synonyms":["residential policy"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"public housing","meaning":"homes provided or supported by government for people in need","translation":"nhà ở công","example":"Public housing can reduce homelessness.","synonyms":["social housing provision"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"urban poverty","meaning":"poverty experienced by people living in towns and cities","translation":"nghèo đô thị","example":"High living costs can worsen urban poverty.","synonyms":["city poverty"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"informal settlement","meaning":"a residential area built without formal planning or legal ownership","translation":"khu định cư không chính thức","example":"Informal settlements often lack reliable water and sanitation.","synonyms":["unplanned settlement"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"residential density","meaning":"the number of homes or residents within a residential area","translation":"mật độ dân cư","example":"Higher residential density can reduce urban sprawl.","synonyms":["housing density"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"city planning","meaning":"the process of organising land use, transport and development in a city","translation":"quy hoạch thành phố","example":"Good city planning should include housing and green space.","synonyms":["urban planning"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"housing affordability","meaning":"the degree to which people can reasonably pay for housing","translation":"khả năng chi trả nhà ở","example":"Housing affordability is a growing concern for younger workers.","synonyms":["affordable housing access"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"commuter town","meaning":"a town where many residents travel elsewhere for work","translation":"thị trấn vệ tinh","example":"Rail links have turned the area into a commuter town.","synonyms":["commuter settlement"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"urban lifestyle","meaning":"a way of life associated with living in a city","translation":"lối sống đô thị","example":"An urban lifestyle may provide convenience but less living space.","synonyms":["city lifestyle"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"local amenities","meaning":"useful facilities and services near where people live","translation":"tiện ích địa phương","example":"Access to local amenities affects property values.","synonyms":["neighbourhood facilities"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"residential neighbourhood","meaning":"an area mainly containing homes","translation":"khu dân cư","example":"The new residential neighbourhood includes schools and parks.","synonyms":["housing area"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Urbanisation & Housing","word":"housing supply","meaning":"the number of homes available in a market","translation":"nguồn cung nhà ở","example":"Increasing housing supply may reduce upward pressure on prices.","synonyms":["supply of homes"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"transport capacity","meaning":"the amount of passengers or goods a transport system can handle","translation":"năng lực vận tải","example":"Growing cities need greater transport capacity.","synonyms":["system capacity"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"rail service","meaning":"a system of passenger or freight trains","translation":"dịch vụ đường sắt","example":"A frequent rail service can reduce car dependence.","synonyms":["train service"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"bus network","meaning":"the connected system of bus routes in an area","translation":"mạng lưới xe buýt","example":"A dense bus network improves access to jobs.","synonyms":["bus system"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"transport link","meaning":"a route or service connecting places","translation":"kết nối giao thông","example":"The new transport link shortened travel times.","synonyms":["travel connection"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"road maintenance","meaning":"the work of repairing and preserving roads","translation":"bảo trì đường bộ","example":"Poor road maintenance increases accident risks.","synonyms":["road repair"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"traffic flow","meaning":"the movement of vehicles through a road system","translation":"luồng giao thông","example":"Better junction design can improve traffic flow.","synonyms":["vehicle movement"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"traffic volume","meaning":"the number of vehicles using a road in a period","translation":"lưu lượng giao thông","example":"Traffic volume is highest during the morning peak.","synonyms":["vehicle volume"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"congestion charge","meaning":"a fee paid to drive in heavily congested areas","translation":"phí ùn tắc","example":"A congestion charge may discourage unnecessary car trips.","synonyms":["road-use fee"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"park-and-ride","meaning":"a system where drivers park outside a city and continue by public transport","translation":"bãi đỗ kết hợp phương tiện công cộng","example":"Park-and-ride schemes can reduce city-centre traffic.","synonyms":["combined parking and transit"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"bus lane","meaning":"a road lane reserved mainly for buses","translation":"làn xe buýt","example":"Dedicated bus lanes can make public transport faster.","synonyms":["priority bus lane"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"railway station","meaning":"a place where trains stop for passengers","translation":"ga đường sắt","example":"The railway station was redesigned to handle more commuters.","synonyms":["train station"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"transport hub","meaning":"a place where several transport services connect","translation":"đầu mối giao thông","example":"The airport functions as a major regional transport hub.","synonyms":["transit hub"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"pedestrian crossing","meaning":"a marked place where people can cross a road","translation":"vạch qua đường","example":"More pedestrian crossings can improve road safety.","synonyms":["crosswalk"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"road user safety","meaning":"protection of drivers, cyclists and pedestrians from road harm","translation":"an toàn người tham gia giao thông","example":"Speed limits are important for road-user safety.","synonyms":["traffic safety"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"cycling infrastructure","meaning":"facilities such as cycle lanes and secure bike parking","translation":"hạ tầng xe đạp","example":"Cycling infrastructure encourages short journeys by bike.","synonyms":["bike infrastructure"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"transport accessibility","meaning":"the ease with which people can reach and use transport","translation":"khả năng tiếp cận giao thông","example":"Transport accessibility is especially important for disabled passengers.","synonyms":["access to transport"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"journey time","meaning":"the amount of time needed to travel from one place to another","translation":"thời gian hành trình","example":"Reliable services can reduce average journey times.","synonyms":["travel time"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"transport cost","meaning":"the money required to operate or use transport","translation":"chi phí giao thông","example":"Fuel prices influence household transport costs.","synonyms":["travel expense"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"public-transport fare","meaning":"the price paid to use buses, trains or similar services","translation":"giá vé giao thông công cộng","example":"Lower public-transport fares may attract more passengers.","synonyms":["transit fare"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"road expansion","meaning":"the process of adding lanes or building more roads","translation":"mở rộng đường bộ","example":"Road expansion can provide temporary relief from congestion.","synonyms":["road widening"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"infrastructure project","meaning":"a large project involving roads, utilities or public systems","translation":"dự án hạ tầng","example":"The infrastructure project created jobs but caused temporary disruption.","synonyms":["public works project"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"transport planning","meaning":"the process of designing and managing movement within an area","translation":"quy hoạch giao thông","example":"Transport planning should consider future population growth.","synonyms":["mobility planning"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"vehicle ownership","meaning":"the condition or rate of people owning private vehicles","translation":"sở hữu phương tiện","example":"Rising incomes often increase vehicle ownership.","synonyms":["car ownership"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"road capacity","meaning":"the maximum number of vehicles a road can carry effectively","translation":"năng lực đường bộ","example":"Adding lanes may increase road capacity in the short term.","synonyms":["traffic capacity"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Transport & Infrastructure","word":"integrated transport","meaning":"a system in which different transport modes connect smoothly","translation":"giao thông tích hợp","example":"Integrated transport makes transfers between bus and rail easier.","synonyms":["connected transport"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"crime prevention strategy","meaning":"a planned approach for reducing criminal activity","translation":"chiến lược phòng chống tội phạm","example":"Youth programmes can form part of a crime-prevention strategy.","synonyms":["prevention plan"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"police presence","meaning":"the visible availability of police in an area","translation":"sự hiện diện của cảnh sát","example":"A stronger police presence may reassure residents.","synonyms":["visible policing"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"public safety","meaning":"the protection of people from crime, accidents and other dangers","translation":"an toàn công cộng","example":"Street lighting contributes to public safety.","synonyms":["community safety"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"crime statistics","meaning":"numerical information about recorded criminal activity","translation":"thống kê tội phạm","example":"Crime statistics should be interpreted carefully.","synonyms":["crime data"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"serious offence","meaning":"a major violation of criminal law","translation":"tội nghiêm trọng","example":"Serious offences usually attract heavier penalties.","synonyms":["major crime"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"minor offence","meaning":"a less serious violation of law","translation":"tội nhẹ","example":"Community service may be suitable for some minor offences.","synonyms":["petty offence"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"repeat offender","meaning":"a person who commits crimes again after previous punishment","translation":"người tái phạm","example":"Rehabilitation aims to reduce the number of repeat offenders.","synonyms":["recidivist"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"crime victim","meaning":"a person harmed by criminal behaviour","translation":"nạn nhân tội phạm","example":"Crime victims may need legal and psychological support.","synonyms":["victim of crime"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"prison population","meaning":"the number of people held in prisons","translation":"dân số nhà tù","example":"Long sentences can increase the prison population.","synonyms":["inmate population"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"youth offender","meaning":"a young person who commits an offence","translation":"người phạm tội trẻ tuổi","example":"Education programmes can help a youth offender return to school.","synonyms":["juvenile offender"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"legal punishment","meaning":"a penalty imposed by law for wrongdoing","translation":"hình phạt pháp lý","example":"Legal punishment should be proportionate to the offence.","synonyms":["criminal penalty"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"court system","meaning":"the network of courts that decides legal cases","translation":"hệ thống tòa án","example":"A slow court system can delay justice.","synonyms":["judicial system"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"criminal investigation","meaning":"the process of collecting evidence about a crime","translation":"điều tra hình sự","example":"Digital evidence is increasingly important in criminal investigations.","synonyms":["police investigation"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"crime scene","meaning":"the place where a crime occurred and evidence may be found","translation":"hiện trường vụ án","example":"Investigators secured the crime scene.","synonyms":["scene of an offence"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"prison education","meaning":"teaching provided to people in prison","translation":"giáo dục trong tù","example":"Prison education can improve employment prospects after release.","synonyms":["inmate education"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"community-based sentence","meaning":"a punishment served in the community rather than prison","translation":"án phạt cộng đồng","example":"Community-based sentences may be suitable for low-risk offenders.","synonyms":["non-custodial punishment"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"victim compensation","meaning":"money or support provided to people harmed by crime","translation":"bồi thường cho nạn nhân","example":"Some legal systems provide victim compensation.","synonyms":["compensation for victims"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"crime deterrence","meaning":"the use of measures intended to discourage crime","translation":"răn đe tội phạm","example":"The certainty of punishment may matter more than severity for crime deterrence.","synonyms":["deterrence"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"police training","meaning":"professional preparation and development for police officers","translation":"đào tạo cảnh sát","example":"Modern policing requires strong police training in communication.","synonyms":["law-enforcement training"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"public order","meaning":"a condition in which public spaces remain peaceful and lawful","translation":"trật tự công cộng","example":"Police are responsible for maintaining public order.","synonyms":["civic order"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"anti-social behaviour","meaning":"behaviour that causes harassment, alarm or distress to others","translation":"hành vi chống đối xã hội","example":"Local authorities use several measures to reduce anti-social behaviour.","synonyms":["disruptive behaviour"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"crime reduction","meaning":"a decrease in the amount or seriousness of criminal activity","translation":"giảm tội phạm","example":"Better youth services may contribute to crime reduction.","synonyms":["lower crime"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"legal responsibility","meaning":"the duty to obey law or answer for legal consequences","translation":"trách nhiệm pháp lý","example":"Drivers have a legal responsibility to stop after serious accidents.","synonyms":["legal duty"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"justice system","meaning":"the institutions and processes dealing with crime and legal disputes","translation":"hệ thống tư pháp","example":"Public trust is essential for an effective justice system.","synonyms":["legal system"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Crime & Justice","word":"offender rehabilitation","meaning":"programmes and support intended to help offenders live lawfully","translation":"phục hồi người phạm tội","example":"Job training is a common element of offender rehabilitation.","synonyms":["criminal rehabilitation"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"policy objective","meaning":"a result that a government policy is intended to achieve","translation":"mục tiêu chính sách","example":"Reducing child poverty is a major policy objective.","synonyms":["policy goal"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"policy measure","meaning":"a specific action used to achieve a policy goal","translation":"biện pháp chính sách","example":"Higher taxes on tobacco are one policy measure.","synonyms":["government measure"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"public programme","meaning":"an organised government-supported service or initiative","translation":"chương trình công","example":"The public programme provides free meals to low-income students.","synonyms":["government programme"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"public investment","meaning":"government spending intended to create long-term benefits","translation":"đầu tư công","example":"Public investment in transport can support economic growth.","synonyms":["state investment"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"state funding","meaning":"money provided by government to support services or programmes","translation":"nguồn tài trợ nhà nước","example":"State funding is essential for many schools and hospitals.","synonyms":["government finance"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"social welfare","meaning":"government support intended to protect people's basic well-being","translation":"phúc lợi xã hội","example":"Social welfare can reduce extreme poverty.","synonyms":["welfare provision"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"welfare benefit","meaning":"money or assistance provided through a social support system","translation":"trợ cấp phúc lợi","example":"Unemployed workers may qualify for a welfare benefit.","synonyms":["social benefit"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"public authority","meaning":"an official organisation with government powers","translation":"cơ quan công quyền","example":"A public authority must follow legal procedures.","synonyms":["government body"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"policy debate","meaning":"public or political discussion about a proposed course of action","translation":"tranh luận chính sách","example":"Housing is at the centre of a national policy debate.","synonyms":["public-policy discussion"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"policy change","meaning":"a modification to an existing government approach","translation":"thay đổi chính sách","example":"A major policy change may take years to show results.","synonyms":["reform"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"citizen consultation","meaning":"a process of seeking views from citizens before public decisions are made","translation":"tham vấn người dân","example":"Citizen consultation can improve acceptance of major local projects.","synonyms":["community consultation"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"public accountability","meaning":"the requirement for public institutions to explain and justify actions","translation":"trách nhiệm giải trình công","example":"Transparent budgets strengthen public accountability.","synonyms":["government accountability"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"public administration","meaning":"the management of government organisations and services","translation":"hành chính công","example":"Digital systems can improve public administration.","synonyms":["government administration"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"government agency","meaning":"an organisation that carries out a particular government function","translation":"cơ quan chính phủ","example":"A government agency monitors food safety.","synonyms":["public agency"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"national budget","meaning":"a government's annual plan for revenue and spending","translation":"ngân sách quốc gia","example":"Healthcare takes a large share of the national budget.","synonyms":["state budget"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"budget allocation","meaning":"the decision to assign money to particular purposes","translation":"phân bổ ngân sách","example":"Budget allocation reflects political priorities.","synonyms":["fund allocation"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"public expenditure","meaning":"money spent by government","translation":"chi tiêu công","example":"Public expenditure increased during the economic slowdown.","synonyms":["government spending"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"policy priority","meaning":"an issue a government considers especially important","translation":"ưu tiên chính sách","example":"Affordable housing has become a policy priority.","synonyms":["government priority"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"regulatory policy","meaning":"rules and measures used by government to control activities","translation":"chính sách quản lý","example":"Regulatory policy can improve product safety.","synonyms":["regulation policy"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"public-sector worker","meaning":"a person employed by government or a public organisation","translation":"nhân viên khu vực công","example":"Teachers and nurses are often public-sector workers.","synonyms":["government employee"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"service provision","meaning":"the act of making a service available to users","translation":"cung cấp dịch vụ","example":"Rural service provision is often more expensive.","synonyms":["delivery of services"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"social support","meaning":"financial or practical help for people facing difficulty","translation":"hỗ trợ xã hội","example":"Strong social support can reduce hardship during unemployment.","synonyms":["welfare support"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"policy effectiveness","meaning":"the degree to which a policy achieves its intended result","translation":"hiệu quả chính sách","example":"Governments should evaluate policy effectiveness using evidence.","synonyms":["policy success"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"administrative cost","meaning":"the expense of managing a programme or organisation","translation":"chi phí hành chính","example":"Complex benefit systems can create high administrative costs.","synonyms":["management cost"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Government & Public Policy","word":"public responsibility","meaning":"a duty held by government or society towards the wider population","translation":"trách nhiệm công","example":"Providing safe drinking water is a basic public responsibility.","synonyms":["social duty"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"household budget","meaning":"a plan for family income and spending","translation":"ngân sách hộ gia đình","example":"Rising food prices put pressure on the household budget.","synonyms":["family budget"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"consumer spending","meaning":"money spent by households on goods and services","translation":"chi tiêu tiêu dùng","example":"Consumer spending often falls during economic uncertainty.","synonyms":["household spending"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"consumer demand","meaning":"the amount of goods and services customers want to buy","translation":"nhu cầu tiêu dùng","example":"High prices can reduce consumer demand.","synonyms":["market demand"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"consumer choice","meaning":"the range and selection of products available to buyers","translation":"lựa chọn của người tiêu dùng","example":"Online markets have expanded consumer choice.","synonyms":["buyer choice"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"purchasing decision","meaning":"a choice about whether and what to buy","translation":"quyết định mua hàng","example":"Advertising can influence a purchasing decision.","synonyms":["buying decision"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"financial literacy","meaning":"knowledge and skills needed to manage money effectively","translation":"hiểu biết tài chính","example":"Schools can improve financial literacy through practical lessons.","synonyms":["money-management knowledge"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"personal finance","meaning":"the management of an individual's income, spending and savings","translation":"tài chính cá nhân","example":"Young adults need basic skills in personal finance.","synonyms":["household finance"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"savings account","meaning":"a bank account designed mainly for storing money and earning interest","translation":"tài khoản tiết kiệm","example":"A savings account can help people build an emergency fund.","synonyms":["deposit account"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"interest rate","meaning":"the percentage charged or paid for borrowing or saving money","translation":"lãi suất","example":"Higher interest rates make loans more expensive.","synonyms":["rate of interest"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"bank loan","meaning":"money borrowed from a bank and repaid over time","translation":"khoản vay ngân hàng","example":"Small businesses may use a bank loan to expand.","synonyms":["bank credit"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"cost of living","meaning":"the amount of money needed for basic everyday expenses","translation":"chi phí sinh hoạt","example":"The cost of living is especially high in large cities.","synonyms":["living costs"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"price increase","meaning":"a rise in the cost of a good or service","translation":"tăng giá","example":"A sudden fuel price increase affects transport costs.","synonyms":["rise in price"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"household debt","meaning":"money owed by individuals or families","translation":"nợ hộ gia đình","example":"High household debt can make families vulnerable to job loss.","synonyms":["family debt"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"financial difficulty","meaning":"a situation in which a person struggles to meet expenses","translation":"khó khăn tài chính","example":"Unexpected medical bills can cause financial difficulty.","synonyms":["money problems"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"after-tax income","meaning":"income remaining after taxes have been paid","translation":"thu nhập sau thuế","example":"After-tax income determines how much households can save or spend.","synonyms":["net income"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"retail sector","meaning":"the part of the economy that sells goods directly to consumers","translation":"ngành bán lẻ","example":"Online shopping has transformed the retail sector.","synonyms":["retail industry"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"small business","meaning":"an independently owned company with relatively few employees","translation":"doanh nghiệp nhỏ","example":"Small businesses create many local jobs.","synonyms":["small enterprise"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"regional business activity","meaning":"economic and commercial activity within a particular region","translation":"hoạt động kinh doanh khu vực","example":"Tourism can stimulate regional business activity.","synonyms":["regional economic activity"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"business growth","meaning":"an increase in a company's sales, size or activity","translation":"tăng trưởng doanh nghiệp","example":"Access to credit can support business growth.","synonyms":["commercial expansion"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"market competition","meaning":"rivalry between firms seeking customers","translation":"cạnh tranh thị trường","example":"Market competition may improve quality and reduce prices.","synonyms":["business competition"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"buying power","meaning":"the amount of goods and services money or income can purchase","translation":"sức mua","example":"Inflation reduces household buying power.","synonyms":["purchasing power"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"consumer protection","meaning":"laws and measures that defend buyers from unfair practices","translation":"bảo vệ người tiêu dùng","example":"Strong consumer protection improves trust in online markets.","synonyms":["buyer protection"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"economic pressure","meaning":"financial conditions that create difficulty for people or organisations","translation":"áp lực kinh tế","example":"High inflation creates economic pressure on low-income households.","synonyms":["financial pressure"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"spending habit","meaning":"a regular pattern in the way a person uses money","translation":"thói quen chi tiêu","example":"Digital payments may change spending habits.","synonyms":["purchasing habit"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Economy & Consumerism","word":"financial security","meaning":"the condition of having enough resources to meet present and future needs","translation":"an toàn tài chính","example":"Stable employment can improve financial security.","synonyms":["economic security"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"advertising message","meaning":"the main idea communicated by an advertisement","translation":"thông điệp quảng cáo","example":"A simple advertising message is easier to remember.","synonyms":["promotional message"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"advertising strategy","meaning":"a planned approach for promoting a product or service","translation":"chiến lược quảng cáo","example":"The company changed its advertising strategy to reach younger consumers.","synonyms":["marketing strategy"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"brand image","meaning":"the public perception and associations linked to a brand","translation":"hình ảnh thương hiệu","example":"Celebrity endorsements can strengthen brand image.","synonyms":["brand identity"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"brand loyalty","meaning":"the tendency of customers to continue choosing the same brand","translation":"lòng trung thành thương hiệu","example":"Good service can increase brand loyalty.","synonyms":["customer loyalty"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"product placement","meaning":"the inclusion of branded products inside entertainment content","translation":"quảng cáo cài cắm","example":"Product placement is common in films and online videos.","synonyms":["embedded advertising"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"commercial pressure","meaning":"influence created by business interests and the need to make profit","translation":"áp lực thương mại","example":"Commercial pressure may affect media content.","synonyms":["business pressure"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"media coverage","meaning":"reporting and attention given to an event or issue by media","translation":"đưa tin truyền thông","example":"Extensive media coverage can shape public debate.","synonyms":["news coverage"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"news source","meaning":"a person, organisation or publication providing news information","translation":"nguồn tin","example":"Readers should compare more than one news source.","synonyms":["information source"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"media outlet","meaning":"an organisation that publishes or broadcasts news and content","translation":"cơ quan truyền thông","example":"Different media outlets may frame the same event differently.","synonyms":["news organisation"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"online advertisement","meaning":"a promotional message shown on websites or apps","translation":"quảng cáo trực tuyến","example":"Online advertisements are often personalised to users.","synonyms":["digital ad"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"advertising revenue","meaning":"income earned from selling advertising space or attention","translation":"doanh thu quảng cáo","example":"Many free websites depend on advertising revenue.","synonyms":["ad income"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"consumer targeting","meaning":"the practice of directing promotions towards selected groups","translation":"nhắm mục tiêu người tiêu dùng","example":"Digital platforms allow precise consumer targeting.","synonyms":["audience targeting"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"marketing technique","meaning":"a method used to promote or sell products","translation":"kỹ thuật tiếp thị","example":"Discounts are a common marketing technique.","synonyms":["promotional method"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"sponsored content","meaning":"media material paid for by a company or advertiser","translation":"nội dung tài trợ","example":"Sponsored content should be clearly labelled.","synonyms":["paid content"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"media consumption","meaning":"the amount and type of media people watch, read or hear","translation":"mức tiêu thụ truyền thông","example":"Mobile devices have changed patterns of media consumption.","synonyms":["media use"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"press report","meaning":"a news article or broadcast produced by journalists","translation":"bản tin báo chí","example":"The press report included comments from local residents.","synonyms":["news report"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"public broadcaster","meaning":"a media organisation funded to provide services for the public","translation":"đài truyền thông công","example":"A public broadcaster may have educational responsibilities.","synonyms":["public media service"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"advertising regulation","meaning":"rules controlling how products and services may be promoted","translation":"quy định quảng cáo","example":"Advertising regulation is especially strict for tobacco.","synonyms":["ad regulation"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"misleading advertisement","meaning":"an advertisement that gives false or deceptive impressions","translation":"quảng cáo gây hiểu lầm","example":"Consumers need protection from misleading advertisements.","synonyms":["deceptive ad"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"advertising exposure","meaning":"the amount of advertising a person sees or hears","translation":"mức độ tiếp xúc quảng cáo","example":"Children receive high advertising exposure online.","synonyms":["exposure to ads"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"media audience","meaning":"the people who consume a particular type of media","translation":"khán giả truyền thông","example":"Streaming services compete for younger media audiences.","synonyms":["viewership"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"marketing campaign","meaning":"a coordinated set of promotional activities","translation":"chiến dịch tiếp thị","example":"The marketing campaign used television and social media.","synonyms":["promotion campaign"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"commercial media","meaning":"media organisations mainly funded through business revenue","translation":"truyền thông thương mại","example":"Commercial media often rely heavily on advertising.","synonyms":["for-profit media"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"promotional material","meaning":"content created to advertise or market something","translation":"tài liệu quảng bá","example":"Tourist boards distribute promotional material online.","synonyms":["marketing material"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Media & Advertising","word":"consumer influence","meaning":"the effect that media or marketing has on customer behaviour","translation":"ảnh hưởng đến người tiêu dùng","example":"Celebrity culture can have strong consumer influence.","synonyms":["buyer influence"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"international movement","meaning":"the movement of people, goods or capital between countries","translation":"sự dịch chuyển quốc tế","example":"Lower travel costs have increased international movement.","synonyms":["cross-border movement"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"cross-border migration","meaning":"the movement of people from one country to another","translation":"di cư xuyên biên giới","example":"Cross-border migration can respond to labour shortages.","synonyms":["international migration"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"migration decision","meaning":"a choice to move from one region or country to another","translation":"quyết định di cư","example":"Employment opportunities strongly affect migration decisions.","synonyms":["decision to migrate"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"migrant worker","meaning":"a person who moves to another place for employment","translation":"lao động di cư","example":"Migrant workers support many sectors of the economy.","synonyms":["mobile worker"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"foreign worker","meaning":"a worker employed in a country other than their own","translation":"lao động nước ngoài","example":"Foreign workers may fill temporary skills gaps.","synonyms":["overseas worker"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"host country","meaning":"a country that receives migrants, visitors or refugees","translation":"nước tiếp nhận","example":"The host country provides language classes for new arrivals.","synonyms":["receiving country"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"home country","meaning":"the country from which a migrant or traveller originates","translation":"quê hương, nước xuất xứ","example":"Many migrants send money to relatives in their home country.","synonyms":["country of origin"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"cultural integration","meaning":"the process of participating in a society while adapting to its norms","translation":"hội nhập văn hóa","example":"Language ability can support cultural integration.","synonyms":["social integration"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"community integration","meaning":"the process of becoming included and connected within a community","translation":"hội nhập cộng đồng","example":"Language classes can support community integration among new arrivals.","synonyms":["social inclusion"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"migration pressure","meaning":"economic or social forces that increase migration","translation":"áp lực di cư","example":"Conflict and unemployment can create migration pressure.","synonyms":["pressure to migrate"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"international student","meaning":"a student studying in a country other than their own","translation":"sinh viên quốc tế","example":"International students contribute to university income and cultural exchange.","synonyms":["overseas student"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"cross-cultural communication","meaning":"communication between people from different cultural backgrounds","translation":"giao tiếp liên văn hóa","example":"Cross-cultural communication is important in international workplaces.","synonyms":["intercultural communication"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"cultural adaptation","meaning":"the process of adjusting to a different culture","translation":"thích nghi văn hóa","example":"Cultural adaptation can take time for new migrants.","synonyms":["cultural adjustment"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"global company","meaning":"a business operating in several countries","translation":"công ty toàn cầu","example":"A global company may recruit staff from many nationalities.","synonyms":["multinational company"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"overseas market","meaning":"a market located in another country","translation":"thị trường nước ngoài","example":"Small firms can now sell directly to overseas markets.","synonyms":["foreign market"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"international business","meaning":"commercial activity involving more than one country","translation":"kinh doanh quốc tế","example":"English is widely used in international business.","synonyms":["global business"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"trade agreement","meaning":"an official arrangement governing trade between countries","translation":"hiệp định thương mại","example":"A trade agreement may reduce import tariffs.","synonyms":["commercial agreement"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"imported goods","meaning":"products brought into a country from abroad","translation":"hàng nhập khẩu","example":"Imported goods give consumers more choice.","synonyms":["imports"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"export market","meaning":"a foreign market where a country's goods are sold","translation":"thị trường xuất khẩu","example":"Manufacturers are looking for new export markets.","synonyms":["overseas market"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"movement of labour","meaning":"the relocation of workers between regions or countries","translation":"dịch chuyển lao động","example":"Free movement of labour can help employers fill vacancies.","synonyms":["labour mobility"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"cultural contact","meaning":"interaction between people from different cultures","translation":"tiếp xúc văn hóa","example":"Tourism creates frequent cultural contact.","synonyms":["intercultural contact"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"global connection","meaning":"a link between people, economies or organisations across countries","translation":"kết nối toàn cầu","example":"Digital communication strengthens global connections.","synonyms":["international link"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"migration benefit","meaning":"a positive outcome associated with migration","translation":"lợi ích của di cư","example":"One migration benefit is the transfer of skills and knowledge.","synonyms":["advantage of migration"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"migration challenge","meaning":"a difficulty created or experienced during migration","translation":"thách thức di cư","example":"Housing shortages can become a migration challenge in fast-growing cities.","synonyms":["migration difficulty"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Globalisation & Migration","word":"international mobility","meaning":"the ability or practice of moving between countries for work or study","translation":"tính di động quốc tế","example":"International mobility is increasingly common among graduates.","synonyms":["global mobility"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"heritage building","meaning":"an old building protected for its historical or cultural value","translation":"tòa nhà di sản","example":"Heritage buildings can attract tourists and support local identity.","synonyms":["historic building"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"heritage conservation","meaning":"the protection and maintenance of culturally important places and objects","translation":"bảo tồn di sản","example":"Heritage conservation requires long-term funding.","synonyms":["historic preservation"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"historic monument","meaning":"a structure preserved because of historical importance","translation":"di tích lịch sử","example":"The historic monument attracts thousands of visitors each year.","synonyms":["memorial site"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"cultural site","meaning":"a place important for art, history, religion or tradition","translation":"địa điểm văn hóa","example":"Tourism income can support the maintenance of cultural sites.","synonyms":["heritage site"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"museum collection","meaning":"a group of objects preserved and displayed by a museum","translation":"bộ sưu tập bảo tàng","example":"The museum collection includes objects from several centuries.","synonyms":["museum holdings"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"cultural practice","meaning":"a customary activity associated with a community or culture","translation":"thực hành văn hóa","example":"Migration can change some cultural practices over time.","synonyms":["cultural custom"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"cultural value","meaning":"a belief or principle considered important within a culture","translation":"giá trị văn hóa","example":"Education can help younger generations understand cultural values.","synonyms":["shared value"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"traditional craft","meaning":"a skill for making objects using methods passed through generations","translation":"nghề thủ công truyền thống","example":"Tourism may create new markets for traditional crafts.","synonyms":["heritage craft"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"historical knowledge","meaning":"understanding of past events and societies","translation":"kiến thức lịch sử","example":"Museums can improve historical knowledge among visitors.","synonyms":["knowledge of history"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"local identity","meaning":"the sense of belonging and distinctiveness linked to a place","translation":"bản sắc địa phương","example":"Traditional festivals can strengthen local identity.","synonyms":["community identity"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"cultural loss","meaning":"the disappearance or weakening of traditions, language or practices","translation":"mất mát văn hóa","example":"Rapid development may contribute to cultural loss.","synonyms":["loss of heritage"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"heritage safeguarding","meaning":"the protection of cultural practices, objects and places from loss","translation":"bảo vệ di sản","example":"Heritage safeguarding requires both funding and community involvement.","synonyms":["heritage protection"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"preserve a tradition","meaning":"to maintain a custom so it continues into the future","translation":"gìn giữ truyền thống","example":"Community groups work to preserve traditions among younger people.","synonyms":["maintain a custom"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"protect a historic site","meaning":"to prevent damage or inappropriate change to an important place","translation":"bảo vệ di tích lịch sử","example":"Strict planning rules can protect historic sites.","synonyms":["conserve a site"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"restore a building","meaning":"to repair an old building so it returns to good condition","translation":"trùng tu tòa nhà","example":"The city plans to restore the building rather than demolish it.","synonyms":["renovate a historic building"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"cultural education","meaning":"teaching about traditions, heritage and cultural understanding","translation":"giáo dục văn hóa","example":"Schools can provide cultural education through local history projects.","synonyms":["heritage education"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"heritage tourism","meaning":"travel motivated by interest in historic and cultural places","translation":"du lịch di sản","example":"Heritage tourism can generate income for preservation.","synonyms":["cultural tourism"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"cultural exchange programme","meaning":"an organised activity that allows people from different cultures to interact","translation":"chương trình trao đổi văn hóa","example":"A cultural exchange programme can reduce stereotypes.","synonyms":["intercultural programme"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"traditional knowledge","meaning":"knowledge passed down through generations within a community","translation":"tri thức truyền thống","example":"Traditional knowledge can contribute to environmental management.","synonyms":["indigenous knowledge"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"modern culture","meaning":"the values, entertainment and lifestyles associated with contemporary society","translation":"văn hóa hiện đại","example":"Global media has a strong influence on modern culture.","synonyms":["contemporary culture"]},{"groupKey":"g2","groupName":"Nhóm 2 - Phát triển Band 5.0-6.5","topicName":"Culture & Heritage","word":"cultural change","meaning":"a shift in 